Extreme caution is advised.  Generally, *NIX systems will handle the ctrl-C
signal appropriately and prevent abortion.  However, most PC's won't.

I would advise saving your game, starting a second one (with -u), and trying
this out.  If you get booted unceremoniously back to the shell (desktop, or
whatever), then you'll know not to try this with your "real" game.
